> ### **AI Biosecurity Risks**
> 
> The integration of artificial intelligence into biosciences raises concerns about potential biosecurity threats that could reach pandemic scales. The development of AI technologies capable of designing novel pathogens demands stringent regulatory frameworks and cross-disciplinary cooperation to mitigate risks. With future advancements, AI could transform various sectors but ensuring its safe application in sensitive areas remains critical. Enhanced collaboration between governments, tech developers, and biosecurity experts is necessary to safeguard against misuse and unintended consequences [23277]. 
